  "description": "The claim analyst is responsible for quick timely processing of deductions.  To accomplish this, the claim analyst needs a thorough understanding of the policies and procedures in documents describing the company's deductions including nonpromotional and promotional claim policies.  With the claim policy advisor, a claim analyst can ask questions in a conversational chat and receive answers based on the contents of the uploaded documents.",
